<Page title="Support · Wardlight" description="Help and contact for Wardlight, a city builder and tower defence for iPhone and iPad." path="/support.html" current="support" lang="en">
<main class="page" id="main">
  <header class="post-head">
    <p class="kicker">Support</p>
    <h1>Help and contact</h1>
    <p class="lede">Found a bug, have an idea or a question about the game? Write to
      <a href="mailto:hello@playwardlight.com">hello@playwardlight.com</a> or open an issue on
      <a href="https://github.com/draskovits/wardlight-site/issues/new">GitHub</a>, and I'll answer as soon as I can.</p>
    <p class="lede">For a bug, it helps to say which device you play on, which land and night you were on, and what happened.</p>
  </header>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <h3>Do I need an account or an internet connection?</h3>
  <p>No. Wardlight is a single-player game. It plays fully offline and has no account.</p>
  <h3>Is my run saved?</h3>
  <p>Yes. The game saves at every dawn, on your device. If you close it during a night, you continue from that night's dawn.</p>
  <h3>How long is a run?</h3>
  <p>About forty minutes: twelve nights, each with an untimed day before it. You can stop after any dawn.</p>
  <h3>Is Wardlight free?</h3>
  <p>The download is free, and so is every run with the Ember Attunement. One in-app purchase, Full Game, adds the Verdant and Dawn Attunements and keeps the Memory open after your third run. Purchases go through the App Store.</p>
  <h3>How do I restore my purchase?</h3>
  <p>Open the ••• menu, then Full game, then Restore purchase, signed in with the same Apple Account.</p>
  <h3>Can I turn off the play data?</h3>
  <p>Yes: Settings → Apps → Wardlight → Share play data. What is sent is in the <a href="/datenschutz.html">privacy policy</a>.</p>

  <section id="deutsch" lang="de">
    <h2>Deutsch</h2>
    <p>Wardlight ist ein Einzelspieler-Spiel für iPhone und iPad, ganz ohne Konto und ohne Internetverbindung.
      Der Spielstand wird bei jeder Morgendämmerung auf deinem Gerät gespeichert.</p>
    <p>Fehler gefunden oder eine Frage? Schreib an <a href="mailto:hello@playwardlight.com">hello@playwardlight.com</a>
      oder über <a href="https://github.com/draskovits/wardlight-site/issues/new">GitHub Issues</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/datenschutz.html">Datenschutz</a> · <a href="/impressum.html">Impressum</a></p>
  </section>
</main>
</Page>
